Hands-on 2 — envFrom

Here the goal is different: instead of selecting one key, we'll inject all ConfigMap keys into the container.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

STEP 01 — Create the Pod

configmap-envfrom.yaml

apiVersion: v1
kind: Pod
metadata:
  name: configmap-envfrom-pod
spec:
  containers:
    - name: app-env
      image: busybox:1.36
      command:
        - sh
        - -c
        - |
          echo "APP_ENV=$APP_ENV"
          echo "APP_PORT=$APP_PORT"
          echo "LOG_LEVEL=$LOG_LEVEL"
          echo "APP_NAME=$APP_NAME"
          sleep 3600
      envFrom:
        - configMapRef:
            name: app-config

